      "id": "get-level-viewport-camera-info",
      "name": "GetLevelViewportCameraInfo",
      "category": "Development",
      "signature": "GetLevelViewportCameraInfo(Target, Camera Location, Camera Rotation)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "ADEPRECATED_PlacedEditorUtilityBase*"
        },
        {
          "name": "Camera Location",
          "type": "FVector&"
        },
        {
          "name": "Camera Rotation",
          "type": "FRotator&"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Bool",
      "docs": "Gets information about the camera position for the primary level editor viewport.  In non-editor builds, these will be zeroed\n@param\tCameraLocation\t(out) Current location of the level editing viewport camera, or zero if none found\n@param\tCameraRotation\t(out) Current rotation of the level editing viewport camera, or zero if none found\n@return\tWhether or not we were able to get a camera for a level editing viewport"
    },
    {
      "id": "set-level-viewport-camera-info",
      "name": "SetLevelViewportCameraInfo",
      "category": "Development",
      "signature": "SetLevelViewportCameraInfo(Target, Camera Location, Camera Rotation)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "ADEPRECATED_PlacedEditorUtilityBase*"
        },
        {
          "name": "Camera Location",
          "type": "FVector"
        },
        {
          "name": "Camera Rotation",
          "type": "FRotator"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Sets information about the camera position for the primary level editor viewport.\n@param\tCameraLocation\tLocation the camera will be moved to.\n@param\tCameraRotation\tRotation the camera will be set to."
